# Reference inputs for the migration — kept LOCAL, not in git (18 MB + 3 MB of
# Google Slides export). Anyone porting a slide needs them on disk: see
# CONTEXT-typst.md for how the exact colours, sizes and positions are read out
# of the pptx XML, and how to rasterize the PDF page to compare against.
#
# Anchored with a leading "/" on purpose: a bare filename matches at ANY depth,
# which would also hide the built out/taller_mayo_2026_col_01.pdf.
/taller_mayo_2026_col_01.pptx
/taller_mayo_2026_col_01.pdf

# Quarto render of factsheet-notes.md. Unlike the notebooks/ HTML (self-contained,
# `embed-resources`), this one ships a 920 KB `_files/libs/` sidecar — regenerable
# from the .md, which IS tracked, so neither half belongs in git.
/factsheet-notes.html
/factsheet-notes_files/
